I'm now revisiting the `InputSection.tsx` file to confirm the authorization code implementation. My focus is on ensuring the file accurately reflects the intended behavior of the `confirmDelete` function. I'm verifying that the password input is correctly integrated and ready for the authorization check against the defined `AUTH_CODE` value. I need to make sure I haven't missed any potential issues or conflicts from previous edits.


